# Ad creative — marketing images and the source that renders them.
# Not part of the app: nothing in src/ or index.html references it and
# Vite only copies public/ into the build, so it could never reach the
# site. Kept out of git because this repo is public and campaign
# artwork has no reason to be. The logos in brand/ itself ARE tracked —
# scripts/icons/build-ico.py and brand/ads/*.html read them.
brand/ads/

# The slur list for text moderation (migration 64). Deliberately not
